            <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 8pt;">
                <p>U.S. Large Cap = Russell 1000, U.S. Small Cap = Russell 2000, Developed International Equity x US = MSCI ACWI ex-US, Emerging Markets Equity = MSCI EM, U.S. Investment-Grade Bonds = Bloomberg Barclays U.S. Aggregate, High Yield = Bloomberg Barclays High Yield, Emerging Markets Debt = Bloomberg Barclays Emerging Markets Debt, Inflation-Linked = Bloomberg Barclays TIPS, Commodities = Bloomberg Commodity.</p>
